3,"Nambikuára, Southern | Accent Network",https://accentnetwork.com/nambikuara-southern/,"Nambikwara. Nambikuára, Southern, Brazil. The Voice of the Rainforest. Get a quote.Southern Nambikuára, spoken by around 1,000 people in Brazil, is part of the Nambikwaran family and is integral to the cultural identity of the Nambikuára people.","Nambikuára, Southern",Nambikwara
